      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">The first contact is a generous wrap of anti‑static bubble film (3 mm bubbles). The air‑filled pockets disperse point impacts and protect against scratches, while the anti‑static coating prevents electro‑static discharge on electronic components.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); font-size: 0.8rem; color: #10b981;">
