      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">2. **High‑Density Foam Inserts**</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Custom‑cut polyethylene foam blocks are placed on the top, bottom and sides of the item. Their high‑density (≈ 30 kg m⁻³) core absorbs vibration from road bumps and reduces the transmission of kinetic energy to the core product.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); font-size: 0.8rem; color: #10b981;">
