      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">5. **Reinforced Wooden Crate**</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">For high‑value or unusually shaped items, a lightweight, kiln‑dried wooden crate is built to the exact dimensions of the wrapped package. The wood distributes loads evenly and protects against punctures that could breach the cardboard.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); font-size: 0.8rem; color: #10b981;">
