<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Ahmedabad To Hyderabad Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical household move from Ahmedabad to Hyderabad take with Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard residential relocation covering the 1,143 km stretch via NH 44/33 usually completes in 3 to 4 business days. The timeline includes loading, secured transit with live GPS monitoring, scheduled check‑points, and unloading at the destination. Factors such as weather, traffic congestion at major junctions, and any additional services requested can slightly adjust the schedule.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an interstate move between Gujarat and Telangana?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Customers must provide a valid government‑issued ID, original address proof, a signed packing list, the e‑Way bill generated for the consignment, and GST registration details if the move is corporate. For vehicle transport, the registration certificate, insurance copy, and a no‑objection certificate (NOC) from the RTO are also needed. Our team assists in preparing and filing each document.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the pricing calculated for household items versus vehicle transport on the Ahmedabad‑Hyderabad route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is a blend of distance‑based freight charges, volumetric weight of packed goods, and specific vehicle‑carrier fees. Household items are billed per cubic foot of packed space, while two‑wheelers and cars are charged based on carrier type (single‑deck trailer or multi‑car hydraulic trailer) and loading complexity. Transparent cost matrices break down each component, ensuring no hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on transporting hazardous or perishable goods between Ahmedabad and Hyderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Hazardous materials such as chemicals, flammable liquids, or compressed gases are prohibited under the IBA mover code and government regulations for interstate road transport. Perishable items can be moved only with specialized refrigerated containers, which must be booked in advance. Our compliance team verifies cargo eligibility before dispatch to avoid regulatory penalties.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures protect fragile items like glassware, temple idols, or electronics during the transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 7‑layer protective packaging system envelops each fragile piece with high‑density bubble wrap, foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard, and weather‑proof stretch film. For high‑value items, we use custom‑crafted wooden crates with reinforced ratchet lashings and wheel chocks for delicate transport. All cargo is secured on hydraulic platforms, and live GPS tracking ensures no unexpected handling.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the live GPS tracking work and can I receive real‑time updates?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each of our container trucks is equipped with satellite GPS devices that transmit location data every five minutes to our central control room. Customers receive a secure link to a web portal where they can view real‑time progress, estimated arrival times, and checkpoint confirmations. Optional SMS alerts are also available for instant updates.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the insurance claim process straightforward if any damage occurs during the Ahmedabad‑Hyderabad move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 100% insured coverage follows an IRDAI‑approved claim workflow. In the unlikely event of damage, the client files a claim within 48 hours, providing photographs, the original packing list, and the damage assessment report. Our dedicated claims team validates the loss, processes the settlement, and typically resolves claims within 7‑10 business days, ensuring a hassle‑free experience.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
